WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.500 --> 00:00:08.550
I was the first to cross the asteroid belt and the first to visit Jupiter.

2
00:00:09.250 --> 00:00:14.470
I carry a golden plaque with a drawing of two humans and a map to our Sun.

3
00:00:15.170 --> 00:00:19.570
My last faint signal reached Earth in 2003.

4
00:00:20.270 --> 00:00:24.640
In about two million years I'll pass near the star Aldebaran.

5
00:00:25.340 --> 00:00:29.810
I carry a picture of you, in case anyone asks.
